{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","data":{"compacted_at":1787354427122778001,"compiled_state":{"alias":"vinyl-cheesy-termite","assignee":null,"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","authorship":{"signed":4,"unsigned":0},"authorship_ledger":[{"content_hash":"9c1e17e2400d2283d737ef8c474d0e9ed16c18111d5d2d65bc4de35f7daa91b7","event_uuid":"e93eaa61-5ece-49fc-80c6-8e2aa276b256","position":{"commit_sha":"0bee31415f32ecd4918c98470fd13985953ddb67","position":"1787352180718047001-e93eaa61-5ece-49fc-80c6-8e2aa276b256"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":null},{"content_hash":"c5962d77c74e66c04b1992b65b25abbfffad90014c28fc19eaf338aa598c457b","event_uuid":"810af54a-fe89-43ed-81d0-fabb5a70d06f","position":{"commit_sha":"2db034a8d205fd03c1999c97744f8ff4688bdb5b","position":"1787352193760277001-810af54a-fe89-43ed-81d0-fabb5a70d06f"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":null},{"content_hash":"d53d396c64b2ca85fe83d716daed1be7b82240a96bf3d91f6b5ca364815515c1","event_uuid":"80aa6b78-0e17-42cd-8cfd-f5a7da43a7f5","position":{"commit_sha":"11ca2679f8a82d4c80551f26947ebd05ce650ef9","position":"1787352200033508001-80aa6b78-0e17-42cd-8cfd-f5a7da43a7f5"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":null},{"content_hash":"ec31dcef187e1e91cfd90aaaf8f9f84fb4f41ff2fa6fad7f83be36def4fd3e6b","event_uuid":"8e9db52f-a659-43af-ada9-ff9443c6782c","position":{"commit_sha":"75f3221e9ba17fa0c44eaabcc359f0ac08fd3749","position":"1787352209444253001-8e9db52f-a659-43af-ada9-ff9443c6782c"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":null}],"bridge_alerts":[],"bridge_project":null,"claim_harness":null,"claim_remote_session":null,"claimed_session":null,"comments":[],"created_at":1787352180718047001,"creation_channel":"cli","deps":[{"link_uuid":"80aa6b78-0e17-42cd-8cfd-f5a7da43a7f5","relation":"relates_to","target_id":"0446-4278-b7df-438d"},{"link_uuid":"8e9db52f-a659-43af-ada9-ff9443c6782c","relation":"relates_to","target_id":"bb73-97de-eeea-4899"}],"description":"## Context / Problem\nThe parent-first cascade is implemented twice: `src/rebar/_commands/claim.py:200-237` (hardcodes the `open` parent via `_resolve_open_parent`) and `src/rebar/_commands/transition.py:421-493` (`_cascade_parent_first`, driven by the `_CASCADING_EDGES` table at `transition.py:414`). The table was added after bug `cranial-sulfur-peafowl` and extended again for `paragonite-fruited-minnow` — both were \"an edge the cascade did not know about\" — and the claim copy still cannot express any edge but `open→in_progress`. The ghost/init preconditions at `transition.py:308-323` and `claim.py:156-169` are byte-identical. Open task `convenient-unrational-songbird` covers the table's one-status-per-edge shape and open bug `despotic-prime-reindeer` covers inbound reconcile bypassing the cascade; this story is the single implementation both of those then build on.\n\n## Approach\nAdd `src/rebar/_commands/lifecycle_cascade.py` with `cascade_parent_first(ticket_id, edge, op, tracker, *, seen, **op_kwargs)` holding the one `_CASCADING_EDGES` table, the TOCTOU re-check, and the error rewrap preserving `ConcurrencyMismatch`; `claim_compute` passes `op=claim_compute` (assignee passthrough kept, `--review` deliberately not propagated per `claim.py:178-183`), `transition_compute` passes itself. Fold the ghost/init triple into `_seam.require_live_ticket`. Guard: `_CASCADING_EDGES` is defined once (AST check, no marker needed).\n\n## Scope\n`src/rebar/_commands/lifecycle_cascade.py` (new), `src/rebar/_commands/claim.py`, `src/rebar/_commands/transition.py`, `src/rebar/_commands/_seam.py`, `tests/unit/commands/test_lifecycle_cascade.py` (new).\n\n## Testing\nHappy path: claiming a child of an open parent claims the parent first on both surfaces. Edge: a parent already taken by another session raises `ConcurrencyMismatch` with the same exit code as today. Pinning: `tests/interfaces/lifecycle/test_claim_transition_parent_cascade.py` and the cascade tests from `cranial-sulfur-peafowl`/`paragonite-fruited-minnow` pass unchanged.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] `grep -rn \"_CASCADING_EDGES\\s*=\" src/rebar` returns one definition; checked by the grep and the guard test.\n- [ ] Every edge in the table is exercised by the same test for both `claim` and `transition`; checked by a parametrised test over the table.\n- [ ] Pinning suites pass unchanged; checked by `pytest`.\n","env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","file_impact":[{"path":"src/rebar/_commands/lifecycle_cascade.py","reason":"consolidation edit or new shared module/test"},{"path":"src/rebar/_commands/claim.py","reason":"consolidation edit or new shared module/test"},{"path":"src/rebar/_commands/transition.py","reason":"consolidation edit or new shared module/test"},{"path":"src/rebar/_commands/_seam.py","reason":"consolidation edit or new shared module/test"},{"path":"tests/unit/commands/test_lifecycle_cascade.py","reason":"consolidation edit or new shared module/test"}],"file_impact_scope":"paths","keyring":[],"managed_refs":[["parent","2ddd-b523-06da-4b4a"],["relates_to","0446-4278-b7df-438d"],["relates_to","bb73-97de-eeea-4899"]],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":"2ddd-b523-06da-4b4a","parent_status_uuid":"","plan_review_phase":"planning","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":2,"repos":[],"reverts":[],"status":"open","tags":["consolidation","janitor","fortnight-review"],"ticket_id":"4329-4761-6e3d-41d7","ticket_type":"story","title":"One parent-first cascade shared by claim and transition","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["e93eaa61-5ece-49fc-80c6-8e2aa276b256","810af54a-fe89-43ed-81d0-fabb5a70d06f","80aa6b78-0e17-42cd-8cfd-f5a7da43a7f5","8e9db52f-a659-43af-ada9-ff9443c6782c"]},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1787354427122778001,"uuid":"93c7251a-a9b2-48a9-81c6-0cb9bd4b8972"}